  "title": {
    "zh": "谐振器熄灯重启",
    "en": "Resonator Black Start"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "安全步进、三件装配、双份读数",
    "en": "Safe CPU ticks, three components and two memory readings"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "收齐 coil、fuse、relay 并到出口。执行 CPU 程序直到 HALT。地址 3 要保留地址 0 与 1 初值的和；地址 4 要保留前三个地址初值之和。先提交部分和，再提交总和，两次都须读内存。CPU 单步会推动巡逻。 限 37 回合，避开巡逻。scan() 列出巡线、目标坐标和 compass 方向表。第二张地图将图纸旋转半圈。",
    "en": "Collect coil, fuse and relay, reach the exit, and run the CPU to HALT. Leave the sum of the original cells 0 and 1 in cell 3, and the sum of original cells 0 through 2 in cell 4. Submit the partial sum followed by the total, both from memory reads. Each CPU step advances the patrols. Avoid patrols within 37 turns. scan() lists patrol cycles, goal locations and the compass for plan directions. The second map rotates the plan by 180 degrees."
  },
